<div class="viewTypeA">
	<div class="viewTop">
		<h2>
			
			
				<span class="b-cate">[공지]</span>
			

			
			
			<span>
				
				2026학년도 2학기 학부, 대학원 외국인유학생 특별전형 모집 안내
			</span>
		</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>등록일 : 
				
					
					
						2026-04-10
					
				
			</li>
			<li>조회 : 8662</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	
		<div class="file">
			<span class="name">첨부파일</span>
			
			
				<a class="file-down-btn Zip" href="?mode=download" data-article="150106" data-attach="81174">
					Undergraduate Course Application Guide.Zip
				</a>
			
				<a class="file-down-btn zip" href="?mode=download" data-article="150106" data-attach="81175">
					Online Application Guide.zip
				</a>
			
				<a class="file-down-btn zip" href="?mode=download" data-article="150106" data-attach="81722">
					Graduate Course Application Guide.zip
				</a>
			
		</div>
	
	<div class="con">
		
			<div class="fr-view"><p>2026학년도 2학기 학부, 대학원 외국인유학생 특별전형 모집을 아래와 같이 실시하오니 많은 관심과 지원바랍니다.</p><p><br></p><p>1. 전형일정</p><table><tbody><tr><td valign="middle"><p>구분</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>1차</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2차</p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" valign="middle"><p>신청 및 서류제출</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.04.13.~04.30.</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.06.01.~06.18.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" valign="middle"><p>※&nbsp;신청 및 제출방법: Uway&nbsp;온라인접수 후 증빙서류 원본 우편제출</p></td></tr><tr><td valign="middle"><p>서류심사 및</p><p>면접고사</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.05.06.~2026.05.21.</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.06.22.~2026.07.08.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign="middle"><p>합격자 발표</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.05.27.</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.07.14.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign="middle"><p>합격자 등록</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.05.27.~06.05.</p></td><td valign="middle"><p>2026.07.14.~07.27.</p></td></tr><tr><td valign="middle"><p>개강</p></td><td colspan="2" valign="middle"><p>2026.09.01.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p>2. 지원서 접수방법</p><p><br></p><p>■ <a href="https://www.uway.com/"><u>https://www.uwayapply.com/</u></a> 을 통한 온라인 접수&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><img src="https://www.tu.ac.kr/_attach/tongmyong/editor-image/2026/04/GHqVGUiXtzLRLCEbpQnnCHaUPW.png" class="fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil" data-path="/_attach/tongmyong/editor-image/2026/04/GHqVGUiXtzLRLCEbpQnnCHaUPW.png" data-size="796408" data-success="true" data-file_name="GHqVGUiXtzLRLCEbpQnnCHaUPW.png" data-width="907" data-alt="screen shot" data-height="329" style="margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px none; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; position: relative; cursor: pointer; display: block; float: none; text-align: left; width: 370.016px;"></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><br></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><img src="https://www.tu.ac.kr/_attach/tongmyong/editor-image/2026/04/hGVgHsNpRsUqdIjCCTiXPSmiKN.png" class="fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil" data-path="/_attach/tongmyong/editor-image/2026/04/hGVgHsNpRsUqdIjCCTiXPSmiKN.png" data-size="749500" data-success="true" data-file_name="hGVgHsNpRsUqdIjCCTiXPSmiKN.png" data-width="899" data-alt="screen shot" data-height="333" style="margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px none; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; position: relative; cursor: pointer; display: block; float: none; text-align: left; width: 366.938px;"></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><br style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.5px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"></p><p><br></p><p>3. 문의</p><p>■ 동명대학교 국제교류처 홈페이지(Homepage) : https://www.tu.ac.kr/global&nbsp;</p><p>■ 주소: &nbsp;우) 48520 부산광역시 남구 신선로 428 동명대학교 국제교류처 국제교류팀(17번 건물 304호)</p><p>■ 전화번호: +82-51-629-3011(학부 담당자) 3012(대학원 담당자)</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>4. 세부내용: 붙임 모집요강 참조</p><p><br></p></div>
		
		
	</div>
</div>

	
	
	
	
